<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.WebSockets</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.WebSockets</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.WebSockets</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.WebSockets — 長時間執行的 WebSocket 客戶端</Title>
    <Description>建立在 BCL ClientWebSocket 之上的長命 WebSocket 客戶端:自動重連(退避+抖動)、重連後自動重放訂閱、閒置逾時存活偵測(ClientWebSocket 的 ping/pong 在協定層自動處理,應用層看不到,只有「多久沒收到訊息」能發現靜默的假連線)、System.Threading.Channels 有界佇列背壓與可觀察的丟棄、以 Result&lt;T&gt; 表達預期失敗。不含任何交易所專屬邏輯,也不做反序列化。A long-lived WebSocket client on top of the BCL ClientWebSocket: automatic reconnect with backoff and jitter, subscription replay after reconnect, idle-timeout liveness detection, bounded-channel backpressure with observable drops, and Result-based failures.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;websocket;websockets;clientwebsocket;reconnect;auto-reconnect;backoff;jitter;heartbeat;idle-timeout;keepalive;backpressure;bounded-channel;channels;subscription;streaming;realtime;market-data;resilience;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.WebSockets</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.WebSockets</RepositoryUrl>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.2.1 — Security fix: the connection log no longer writes the URI's path or query, only the scheme and host. A path can carry a credential (a Binance user data stream is wss://host/ws/&lt;listenKey&gt;) and this line is written on every reconnect, so the log was accumulating usable credentials. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.WebSockets/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    相依政策:只允許 .NET BCL、Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件,判定看的是遞移相依樹而非套件名稱。
    Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions 只帶進 Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions
    與 Microsoft.Extensions.Options,整棵樹仍然只有 Microsoft.* 與 System.*。
    Dependency policy: BCL, Microsoft first-party packages, and Ozakboy.* only, judged by the transitive graph
    rather than by package name. The logging abstractions pull in nothing outside Microsoft.* and System.*.
  -->
  <!--
    測試專案需要驗證少數內部輔助邏輯(例如閒置檢查間隔的推導),為此把它們提升為公開 API 會讓契約
    多出不該由呼叫端看到的東西。
    The test project verifies a few internal helpers, such as how the idle check interval is derived. Promoting them
    to public API just for that would add things to the contract that callers have no business seeing.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Ozakboy.WebSockets.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Ozakboy.Core.Abstractions" Version="0.3.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="10.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,只要設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可產生原始碼連結;外掛套件反而會帶進額外的相依鏈,也會讓還原失敗。
    Deliberately does not reference Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub: the SDK has had SourceLink built in since
    .NET 8, and the add-on package only adds a dependency chain (and breaks restore).
  -->

</Project>
